=== 2. the closed form for the odd numbers ===
  max | q(1-q)G_odds(q) - [1 - q + q^2 - q^{k+1} - (1-q)^{k+1}] | = 4.09e-10
  roots of the limit 1 - q + q^2 : q = (1 +- i sqrt3)/2 = exp(+- i pi/3)
    Re = 0.500000   Im = 0.866025   |q| = 1.000000   |1-q| = 1.000000

